      "author": "Marcus Lim",
      "text": "I have the Anselm Bank renewal in Singapore on 23-24 June. It is a customer commitment, not a focus block \u2014 I cannot be in Muskoka those days.",
      "ts": "2026-06-08T07:50:00"
    },
    {
      "author": "Beatriz Almeida",
      "text": "My approved leave is the whole week of 22 June.",
      "ts": "2026-06-08T07:55:00"
    },
    {
      "author": "Maren Achterberg",
      "text": "Reminder: the 29 June week is Kestrel's boathouse rebuild, and 20 July is held for the customer success retreat \u2014 neither is ours to take. Owen's field conference in early July is protected; only Petra can move it. The KL-5508 quote on the drive is a duplicate for the wrong week \u2014 use KL-5522.",
      "ts": "2026-06-08T08:20:00"
    }
  ],
